# IQE-QDC-002: Designs with low Unified Quality Score (UQS < 0.6)
# Surfaces quality debt — designs that need gate remediation.

foreach a in qdc.assessments
where a.uqs_score < 0.6
select a.design_id, a.design_name, a.uqs_score, a.score, a.created_at
# Presentation (IQE has no `order by` or `limit`; the reader applies it): sort by a.uqs_score asc.
